               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_N202E2">Written in brown ink. Paper: 16 staves. Title above the first stave: "Choral (til en Brudevielse. - Før Talen". Signed I:P:E: Hartmann and dated: "d: 26 Novbr: 1844." "Efter Talen" dated "27 Novbr: 1844". Last two pages blank.</physMedium>
